        <font color="#000000" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> from what I understand, you can pull him straight over the wall, a necro friend of mine here at work said he charmed him once &lt;beguile undead&gt; and his new pet just popped through the wall and into the water next to him. from talking to people who've raided through- there's way too many mobs wandering on top of the wall for us to just sit and camp unless we had another full raid like sat. night- easiest way up w/o going through the lift is grav flux- i have a map that shows where to stand to grav flux yourself/others up top- if anybody is interested in this method &lt;and we can find people who have it&gt; then i can post the link &lt;I think grav fluxing chakar up (since his safefall will prevent a lot of the damage) and letting him pull the skeleton over the gatehouse might work as well, if we can't find a necro</P><P><BR>Strade Fyreseed<BR>Elvin "Fashion" Wizzard<a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
